uble precision there's a few tricks used to\r\nemulate double precision with floats only. In one instance precision\r\nmust be recovered after doing `read_view_matrix * model_matrix` so the\r\ntranslation part must be recomputed as `model_origin - inv_view_origin`.\r\nBut this operation was written as `model_origin + inv_view_origin`, so\r\nwhat was done before was to pass `inv_view_origin` as its negative to\r\nthe shader in `render_scene_data_rd.cpp`...\r\n\r\nThis commit removes the negation from `render_scene_data_rd.cpp` and\r\ninstead does the substraction in the shader.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1609442062,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNjA5NDQyMDYy","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:shaders","name":"topic:shaders","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}",